<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32857" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ŏpŭlentĭa</span></b> ,
			ae, f.
		opulens, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>riches</i>, <i>wealth</i>, <i>opulence</i> (not in Cic. or Cæs.).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">habemus publice egestatem, privatim opulentiam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sall. C. 52, 22</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">opulentia neglegentiam tolerabat,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					ib. 52</span></i>
			. 9: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Trojae opulentia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 7, 262</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">metallorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					2, 93, 95, § 207</span></i>
			.—In plur.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">deos decent opulentiae et factiones,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Trin. 2, 4, 89</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. Bacch. 3, 4, 17</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">copiis atque opulentiis anteire,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell.
					20, 5, 8</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, like opes, <i>resources</i>, <i>power</i>, of a people: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">invidia ex opulentiā orta est,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sall.
					C. 6, 3</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Nep.
				Cim. 2, 5</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Lydorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. A.
					4, 55</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>richness</i>, etc.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">linguae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Claud. Cons. Mall. Theod. 21</span></i>
			</div>
